  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 4365213696
    m_Localized: 'Inspection started: {0} on the clock. Find all {1} hazards!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4453294080
    m_Localized: Calculating your results...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488384
    m_Localized: Point at an answer and pull the trigger, then press A to submit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488385
    m_Localized: Dangerous choice, logged for safety review. Choose again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488386
    m_Localized: Logged as a mistake. Choose again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488387
    m_Localized: Submit answer {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488388
    m_Localized: Submit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488389
    m_Localized: Finish the inspection?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488390
    m_Localized: 'You may have missed some hazards. Anything you have not found counts
      as missed.

      Continue inspecting or submit now?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488391
    m_Localized: Submit your inspection now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488392
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488393
    m_Localized: "Resolved <b>{0}/{1}</b>     <color={2}>X controls  \xB7  Y finish</color>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488394
    m_Localized: DANGEROUS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488395
    m_Localized: Close
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488396
    m_Localized: Controls
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488397
    m_Localized: '<b>WASD</b> walk

      <b>Hold right mouse</b> to look

      <b>Left
      click</b> to select

      <b>Enter</b> submit   <b>Esc</b> close

      <b>H</b>
      controls   <b>F</b> finish'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488398
    m_Localized: "<b><color={0}>Trigger</color></b>  select / inspect\n<b>Stick forward</b> 
      aim, release to teleport\n<b>Stick left/right</b>  turn 45\xB0    <b>back</b> 
      turn around\n<b>A</b>  submit    <b>B</b>  close\n<b>X</b>  this card    <b>Y
      / Menu</b>  finish"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488399
    m_Localized: LAB SAFETY INSPECTION
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488400
    m_Localized: remaining
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488401
    m_Localized: Inspection Station
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488402
    m_Localized: Done early? Submit here, or press Y / Menu.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488403
    m_Localized: Finish Inspection
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488404
    m_Localized: Looks OK. Keep inspecting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488405
    m_Localized: '{0}: looks OK.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488406
    m_Localized: 'Hazard resolved: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488407
    m_Localized: Time's up!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488408
    m_Localized: All hazards resolved!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488409
    m_Localized: Inspection submitted
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488410
    m_Localized: Nice! Stick forward teleports, left/right turns.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488411
    m_Localized: Selected! In the lab, this opens a safety question.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488412
    m_Localized: You've got it. Press Start Lab when ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488413
    m_Localized: Done
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488414
    m_Localized: '<b>Teleport</b> onto the glowing ring: push a stick forward, aim
      the arc at the ring, release.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488415
    m_Localized: '<b>Select</b> the coffee cup: point at it and pull the trigger.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488416
    m_Localized: Start Lab  (A)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488417
    m_Localized: Start Lab
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488418
    m_Localized: "TUM \xB7 ETH  \u2014  LAB SAFETY INITIATIVE"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488419
    m_Localized: Lab Safety Inspection
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488420
    m_Localized: LANGUAGE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488421
    m_Localized: HAZARDS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488422
    m_Localized: Choose hazards
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488423
    m_Localized: 60-SECOND WARM-UP
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488424
    m_Localized: 'In the lab: find each hazard, choose the safest action. Right answer
      = hazard fixed. Wrong answer = logged as a mistake.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488425
    m_Localized: Hazards in the lab
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488426
    m_Localized: Switch hazards on or off, then choose how many to plant each run.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488427
    m_Localized: PLANTED HAZARDS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488428
    m_Localized: OFF
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488429
    m_Localized: HAZARDS PER RUN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488430
    m_Localized: 'Safety-critical: must be answered correctly to pass.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488431
    m_Localized: Switch all on
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488432
    m_Localized: At least one hazard has to stay on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488433
    m_Localized: Each run plants {0} of the {1} hazards that are on, picked at random.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488434
    m_Localized: "BSL-1 laboratory \xB7 {0} hidden hazards \xB7 7 minutes"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488435
    m_Localized: Your controller
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488436
    m_Localized: 'Pull the <b><color={0}>TRIGGER</color></b> to select.

      <b>Stick
      forward</b> teleport   <b>left/right</b> turn

      <b>A</b> confirm   <b>B</b>
      close   <b>X</b> controls'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488437
    m_Localized: 'TRIGGER

      <size=70%>select</size>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488438
    m_Localized: 'STICK

      <size=70%>teleport / turn</size>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457488439
    m_Localized: GRIP
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
